      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Crumpled paper represents 'white trash'",
      "description": "The visual metaphor of crumpled paper, symbolizing discarded or worthless items, is mapped onto the textual concept of 'white trash'. The text explicitly labels the website as a gathering place for 'white trash', and the visual material (crumpled paper) serves as a direct analogical representation of this derogatory label, reinforcing the meme's hateful message by equating the group with trash.",
